FILE: vUX-touchHandler.js
FEATURE: component-teardown
DATE: 2026-09-17
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'resizer-docs'

REASON
addTouchEventHandler() bound gesture listeners to the frame plus an anonymous
transitionend listener and an anonymous window resize listener. The two anonymous ones
were unremovable, so a TouchHandler whose frame was swapped out by the SPA engine kept
recalculating its slope on every window resize for the life of the page. They are now
named, a mirrored removeTouchEventHandler() detaches everything addTouchEventHandler()
binds (using the same pointer names checkSupport() settled on), and destroy() calls it.

